Explanation II.In assessing the loss of earning capacity for the purposes of sub-clause (ii),
the qualified medical practitioner shall have due regard to the percentages of loss of earning capacity in relation to different injuries specified in Schedule I;
(d) where temporary disablement, whether total or partial results from the injury a half-monthly payment of the sum equivalent to twenty-five per cent. of monthly wages of the https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis [employee], to be paid in accordance with the provisions of sub-section (2).
